          "normalized_marker": "19",
          "occurrence": 1,
          "source_text": "95. Cases of suicide because of madness can be found in the following folders of the XBDA: 06401 (Fengtian bureau), 9445-47 (Jiangsu bureau), 09925 (Anhui) 10348-49 (Jiangsu), 10852 (Fujian) 11401 (Zhejiang bureau), 13609-10 (Huguang), 15474-76 (Henan), 17352-33 (Shandong), 18428 (Shanxi), 19646 (Shaanxi), 19975 (Sichuan). 20936 (Guangdong). Some cases of suicide because of other illnesses: 10850 (Fujian), 13611",
