          "marker": "21",
          "normalized_marker": "21",
          "occurrence": 1,
          "source_text": "97. The term for madness could change from case to case, but not the sentence structure: 想是病发糊涂所致, 想是颠病覆发所致, 想是病发所致, etc.",
